; Rescued, not a starter: the Enchanted Forest's chapter wizard, freed by running her walking hut down
; (.ai/chapter-wizards.md 4.1). The witch of the deep wood, whose hut stands behind a fence of bone. Her
; passive is Bone Fence, the one axis no other wizard owns: every shove and pull her spells give lands
; harder (+20% knockback). She opens on Thorned Vine, two elements (Grass and Poison) - a freed wizard may
; (R2); the form deepens Grass. She flies in her mortar, broom in hand (roster.yaga, anim_sets.hover); her Feet
; collider meets water and walls as everyone's does, but the mortar floats: RidesOverWater (in-flight 74, Eric
; 2026-11-09) - water never slows or sinks her, and rings spread round it.
